            <div xml:id="d211">

                <pb facs="0385" n="325" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg325"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Señor Fontecilla to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of Chili,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-03-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 30, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have had the honor to receive the note of
                    the honorable Secretary of State, dated the 28th instant, and the adjoined
                    circular of which a copy was sent me.</p>
                <p>I have hastened to transmit it to my government, which, duly thanking the good
                    offices of the honorable Secretary of State, will, I doubt not, take it into
                    consideration without loss of time.</p>
                <p>I improve this opportunity to express to the honorable Secretary of State the
                    sentiments of my most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>M. SANCHEZ FONTECILLA.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d211-a1.xml" xpointer="d211-a1"/>
            </div>
